
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>403 - Access Denied | CloudDemo</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>

    <nav>
        <h2>CloudDemo</h2>
    </nav>

    <main class="container error-container">

        <h1 class="error-code">403</h1>

        <h2>Access Denied!</h2>

        <p>
            Your request could not be verified.
            Direct access to this application is not allowed.
        </p>

        <p>
            Please access this application through the authorized entry point.
        </p>

        <div class="security-info">
            <p><strong>Security Status:</strong> Request Rejected</p>
            <p><strong>HTTP Status:</strong> 403 Forbidden</p>
        </div>

    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>CloudDemo | Secure Cloud Deployment</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
